cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fibretrack_ak: fibre tracking, orientation and twisted-yarn theory tests for X-ray CT"
abstract: >-
  Tracks individual fibres and measures fibre orientation, twist and migration in
  X-ray computed tomography of yarns and fibre composites (glass, carbon, hybrid),
  then tests the result against classical twisted-yarn theory (ideal helix,
  migration, blend segregation). Also packaged as a Claude skill.
type: software
